 "brief_summary": "To assess the efficacy and safety of vildagliptin add-on therapy to reduce HbA1c in patients with T2DM inadequately controlled by insulin, with or without concurrent metformin therapy.",
 "eligibility": {
  "criteria": "Inclusion Criteria:\n\n* Confirmed diagnosis of T2DM\n* On a stable dose of insulin as defined by the protocol\n* On a stable does of metformin (if applicable) as defined by the protocol\n* Age 18 to 80 years\n* HbA1c of 7.5 to 11.0%\n* Body Mass Index (BMI) 22 to 40 kg/m2\n\nExclusion Criteria:\n\n* Type 1 diabetes\n* Short-acting or rapid-acting insulin\n* Pregnancy or lactation\n* Evidence of serious diabetic complications\n* Evidence of serious cardiovascular complications\n* Laboratory value abnormalities as defined by the protocol\n* Other protocol-defined inclusion/exclusion criteria may apply",
  "sex": "ALL",
  "minimum_age": "18 Years",
  "maximum_age": "80 Years",
